  "content_id": "16136176",
  "title": "Kado Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Why Was My Kado ACH or Bank Wire Transfer Transaction Declined?\nIf your Kado transaction was declined, it’s often due to bank restrictions...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My Kado ACH or Bank Wire Transfer Transaction Declined?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your Kado transaction was declined, it’s often due to bank restrictions, verification issues, or incorrect account information. Here's a quick overview of common causes and how to resolve them:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Bank Restrictions:</b> Some banks block or delay ACH and wire transfers related to crypto</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Insufficient Funds:</b> Your bank account doesn't have enough balance to cover the transaction</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Incorrect Bank Details:</b> Mistyped routing or account numbers can cause a failure</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> Missing or unverified identity documents or bank info</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Review:</b> Transactions may be auto-declined if flagged as suspicious</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Confirm your bank allows ACH/wire crypto transfers</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Double-check all bank account and routing details</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete any pending KYC verification steps</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (including spam) for messages from Kado</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry after 24 hours in case of temporary declines</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://faq.kado.money/en/article/contact-kado-support-jpixds/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Kado Support</b></a><b>: </b><b>https://faq.kado.money/en/article/contact-kado-support-jpixds/</b></p></li></ol>",
